From bcdf443e278032d92c9ff498e0805a0f1b443f14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 01:19:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] display: add an outdoor mode toggle under brightness

outdoor mode only lives in the livedisplay page, which has no entry
in settings, so there is no way to reach it.

add a switch to the brightness category that sets the livedisplay
mode to outdoor or off.
